rld-islands-whats-happening" data-faviconid="ODF.2g2MV_-tuTCVF6jrIqKZxA" data-domain="Time Out Dubai"><div class="b_ts_source_fav b_ts_flex"><img src="blob:https://www.bing.com/72a4f2cd-0137-47bd-a59a-78822a7adf96" data-bm="9"></div><span class="b_ts_source"></span></li><li class="b_ts_source_pill b_ts_flex b_hide" data-title="The Story Behind the Abandoned World Islands Project, Dubai" data-snippet="Sitting around 2.5 miles off the coast of Dubai in the Persian Gulf, The World Islands are a collection of smaller islands designed to replicate the world in miniature, with each island named after its corresponding country." data-url="https://elitetraveler.com/property/story-behind-world-islands-dubai" data-faviconid="ODF.qRL_kZwYCmxm-Dc5opRc1g" data-domain="Elite Traveler"><div class="b_ts_source_fav b_ts_flex"><img src="blob:https://www.bing.com/4704d588-e180-4f7f-817a-a0433813de04" data-bm="10"></div><span class="b_ts_source"></span></li><li class="b_ts_source_pill b_ts_flex b_hide" data-title="Dubai World Islands Revival 2025: What Buyers Should Know" data-snippet="Dubai World Islands: a man-made archipelago with luxury resorts, private villas, and prime investments. Map, status, prices, and how to visit." data-url="https://keltandcorealty.com/dubai-world-islands/" data-faviconid="ODF.G61rM7Zn1wPJk3gfwhePmw" data-domain="keltandcorealty.com"><div class="b_ts_source_fav b_ts_flex"><img src="blob:https://www.bing.com/1998a4a3-c5a1-4508-8c81-4a2bdd9ce33d" data-bm="11"></div><span class="b_ts_source"></span></li><li class="b_ts_source_pill b_ts_flex b_hide" data-title="The World Islands - All You SHOULD Know Before Going 2026 ... - Tripadvisor" data-snippet="The World Islands is a project a few kilometers off the Dubai shoreline. I had the opportunity to sail out to The World Islands in 2008 and it was very impressive at that time, but you could see then the sea was eroding the man-made islands at an alarming rate." data-url="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Revi